      "fix": "Require the reviewed issue version on both operator endpoints, reject conflicting writes with HTTP 409, and validate malformed input. Freeze reviewed fields during save; require a reload after an uncertain or conflicting save."
    },
    {
      "id": "ADMIN-03",
      "fix": "Prevent duplicate configuration-publication submissions; capture and lock the exact proof and audit reason during publication."
    },
    {
      "id": "ADMIN-04",
      "fix": "Discard pending daily-bonus reconciliation results after the selected day or reviewed hash changes."
    },
    {
      "id": "ADMIN-05",
      "fix": "Recover service-fee and legacy-policy editing in a new session while an old save is unresolved; old callbacks cannot reset the new form."
    },
    {
      "id": "ADMIN-06",
      "fix": "Clear authority rules and audit reasons on logout; lock signing controls while signing and after failed settings verification. Check the original session again after asynchronous finalization and before publication."
    },
    {
      "id": "ADMIN-07",
      "fix": "Replace stale audit history with an explicit unavailable state and refresh action when reads fail."
    }
